  {:id :LOOP-STALE-REPAIR-012 :status :active
   :ears "When stale repair is enabled (test-focus --repair-stale, check! :repair-stale true, or :kaocha-sublime/repair-stale true in tests.edn) and a check finds refused refers or stale mappings in namespaces inside the reloaded closure, the runner shall ns-unmap those mappings, reload the affected namespaces again in dependency order, and re-run the stale checks; the verdict may continue toward pass only when the re-check is clean, the receipt shall list each repair (namespace, var, was, now) and repair-ms, and referrers outside the closure shall remain reported as stale so the status stays fail. Repair shall never remove-ns, never reload namespaces outside the closure, and never run when repair is disabled (the default)."
